LOG_LEVEL="The level of logging: DEBUG < INFO < WARNING < ERROR < CRITICAL i.e. DEBUG will show all logs, whereas CRITICAL will only show CRITICAL logs - defaults to INFO"
MODEL="The identifier of the target model, e.g. qwen2.5-coder:3b - see https://ollama.com/library"
MODEL_API_BASE_URL="The OpenAI compatible API base URL"
MODEL_API_KEY="The API key"
